cipants who pay close attention to specific protocol fundamentals rather than just passively following broad trends. These targeted investments require careful analysis of network activity, active user growth, and sustainable revenue metrics to identify the most promising opportunities.\n 24 \n 25 ### The rise of Hyperliquid and HIP-3\n    ...","firstChangedLine":21},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779705877623}}
